+Options:
+
+- `--min-qty N` — only report items with quantity at least `N` (default 0).
+- `--format {table,json}` — output format (default `table`).
+  `json` prints a JSON array of objects with keys `name`, `qty` and `price`,
+  sorted by name; anything else (e.g. warnings about skipped rows) goes to
+  stderr. An unknown format is a usage error (exit status 2).
+
